From e7e35579b8058bbacb2408dce67b8fb7dd39f9b4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jason McCartney <jmacAJ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 10:16:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 34/37] fix(glm): enforce real C4 serving capacity

Reject undersized manual KV pools for the four-stream appliance and require a staggered 16K residency check before declaring the service ready.

Co-authored-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
